# Dialect: ANS Forth (portable)

Target **ANS Forth** / DPANS94 portability. Do not use Gforth-only syntax (`{ locals }`, `"foo"` literals, `$@`, etc.) unless the user explicitly asks for Gforth.

Prefer standard CORE / CORE-EXT words and `CELL`/`CHARS` sizing. Document environmental dependencies for any extension word.
